# V-59 FIX: Do NOT bake secrets into image layers. The ${VAR:?} syntax
# requires the variable at BUILD time, which bakes the value into the
# image layer (visible via `docker history`). Instead, require them at
# RUNTIME via the application's startup check.
# ENV JWT_SECRET_KEY=${JWT_SECRET_KEY:?JWT_SECRET_KEY is required}
# ENV ENGINEERING_SERVICE_API_KEY=${ENGINEERING_SERVICE_API_KEY:?ENGINEERING_SERVICE_API_KEY is required}

# Force production mode — enables all security guards (no test-mode bypass,
# no weak JWT fallback, no AUTH_RETURN_RESET_TOKEN leak).
